<title>USA: Monarch Machine names Richard Clemens CEO.</title>
<headline>Monarch Machine names Richard Clemens CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SIDNEY, Ohio 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monarch Machine Tool Co said on Tuesday its board of directors named Richard Clemens as president, chief executive officer and member of the board effective March 10.  </p>
<p>The company said Clemens will replace David Lundeen, who has been working as acting president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Clemens was vice president and general manager of the Frick Co, a division of York International Corp, since July 1995, it said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
